===persian===

در هر نگاه...
یک وصل... یک هجران...
در هر نگاه...
یک تبسّم... یک آه...
۱۳۷۶/۵/۷

===machine===

In every look...
one meeting... one parting...
In every look...
one smile... one sigh...
1376/5/7

===lantern===

In every look,
one meeting and one parting.
In every look,
one smile and one sigh.

1376/5/7

